 "storyArc": "The neighbourhood holds a meeting about Altamira's plan for a hotel taking up the whole block. Some neighbours think it is progress; the bakery thinks it is the end; Doña Gloria thinks it is important that everyone says what they think, loudly. Tomás stands up and, in a Spanish that surprises everyone, says he doesn't think it is fair that a corner with a hundred years of history becomes a lobby.",
